<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - M.S. Carriers, Allied Holdings.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - M.S. Carriers, Allied Holdings.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it upgraded ratings on M.S. Carriers Inc and Allied Holdings Inc to buy from market performer.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- M.S. Carriers rose 7/8 to 18-7/8 and Allied Holdings gained 1/4 to 6-1/4.</p>
</text>
